WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.354
Meet Brief,

00:00:01.354 --> 00:00:03.910
an intelligent document management platform

00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:05.396
that makes understanding,

00:00:05.396 --> 00:00:05.991
exploring,

00:00:05.991 --> 00:00:07.596
and managing your documents

00:00:07.596 --> 00:00:08.845
simpler and smarter

00:00:09.425 --> 00:00:12.057
Long documents can take hours to understand

00:00:12.057 --> 00:00:13.787
Brief simplifies the process

00:00:13.787 --> 00:00:16.630
by helping you discover important information,

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:19.531
without manually searching through every page

00:00:20.111 --> 00:00:21.876
Simply upload your PDF

00:00:21.876 --> 00:00:23.285
Depending on its length,

00:00:23.285 --> 00:00:25.575
Brief takes anywhere from a few seconds

00:00:25.575 --> 00:00:27.748
to a couple of minutes to process it,

00:00:27.748 --> 00:00:29.099
then makes the overview

00:00:29.099 --> 00:00:30.628
and AI chatbot available

00:00:31.208 --> 00:00:33.456
Get a clear overview of your document,

00:00:33.456 --> 00:00:34.875
understand its contents,

00:00:34.875 --> 00:00:36.058
and quickly identify

00:00:36.058 --> 00:00:37.834
the information that matters

00:00:38.414 --> 00:00:39.614
Have questions?

00:00:39.614 --> 00:00:40.864
Just ask Brief

00:00:40.864 --> 00:00:43.257
Its AI-powered chatbot lets you interact

00:00:43.257 --> 00:00:44.453
with your documents,

00:00:44.453 --> 00:00:45.949
and find relevant answers

00:00:45.949 --> 00:00:47.804
through a simple conversation

00:00:48.384 --> 00:00:49.636
Explore your documents

00:00:49.636 --> 00:00:51.458
through a centralized dashboard,

00:00:51.458 --> 00:00:52.938
where you can conveniently

00:00:52.938 --> 00:00:54.077
view their overviews

00:00:54.077 --> 00:00:55.620
and important information

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:57.679
Need to share your insights?

00:00:57.679 --> 00:01:00.192
Brief lets you share a view-only dashboard,

00:01:00.192 --> 00:01:02.647
allowing others to explore the information

00:01:02.647 --> 00:01:04.701
without editing your documents

00:01:04.701 --> 00:01:06.604
You can even email the invitation,

00:01:06.604 --> 00:01:09.299
with the link and code already written for you

00:01:09.879 --> 00:01:11.880
Your security and control matter

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:14.027
Brief offers two-step verification,

00:01:14.027 --> 00:01:16.850
a Bin where deleted documents can be restored,

00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:17.709
and the option

00:01:17.709 --> 00:01:19.915
to permanently delete your account

00:01:20.495 --> 00:01:21.677
Understand more

00:01:21.677 --> 00:01:22.685
Search less

00:01:22.685 --> 00:01:23.985
Work smarter with Brief
